flowchart TD
    Start([Usuário acessa /]) --> Login{Autenticado?}
    Login -->|Não| SignIn[/AdminLogin<br/>Lovable Cloud Auth/]
    SignIn --> ProfileGate{Perfil completo?}
    Login -->|Sim| ProfileGate
    ProfileGate -->|Não| Profile[Profile Completion Gate]
    Profile --> Hub
    ProfileGate -->|Sim| Hub[Index / Hub Principal]

    Hub --> Approvals[ApprovalsHub]
    Hub --> Expenses[Expenses]
    Hub --> NF[NF Entrada]
    Hub --> PagCorp[PagCorp]
    Hub --> Audit[AuditHub]
    Hub --> Integr[IntegrationsHub]
    Hub --> Admin{Admin?}
    Admin -->|Sim| AdminPanel[Admin / Users / Credentials]

    Approvals --> Decide[Aprovar / Rejeitar]
    Decide --> SapVal[Validação SAP B1]
    SapVal --> Persist[(Postgres + audit_log)]
    Persist --> Notify[Notificações<br/>Email / WhatsApp]

    Expenses --> UploadDoc[Upload NF / Boleto]
    UploadDoc --> AIExtract[Edge Function<br/>extração via AI Gateway]
    AIExtract --> Persist

    NF --> Import[Importar XML]
    Import --> CrossFiscal[Cross-fiscal ERP]
    CrossFiscal --> Persist
